      "source": [
        "### Download and Prepare Bank Marketing Dataset\n",
        "\n",
        "The `bankmarketing.csv` file was not found. This section will download a publicly available 'Bank Marketing' dataset from the UCI Machine Learning Repository, extract the relevant CSV file, and rename it to `bankmarketing.csv` to allow the subsequent cells to run as intended."
      ],
      "id": "2f19e86b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
